OL,3,ATexas mayor instructs police to limit
OL,4,Aco-operation with ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of Houston, Texas, has
OL,7,Fdirected the city's police to limit
OL,8,Fco-operation with federal immigration
OL,9,Fofficials.
OL,11,FThe move by John Whitmire, a Democrat,
OL,12,Fcomes on the heels of stunning
OL,13,Fvictories by the party in Texas during
OL,14,Fthis week's midterm elections. It
OL,15,Fbreaks with policy set by Republican
OL,16,FGovernor Greg Abbott, who lost his
OL,17,Fre-election bid.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
