OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATexas mayor instructs police to limit
OL,4,Aco-operation with ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I do this to begin a healing process,"
OL,7,FWhitmire said on Friday, and to "reduce
OL,8,Ffear and anxiety across our community".
OL,9,FHe added: "I also do this knowing that
OL,10,Felections matter."
OL,12,FThere has been months of public outcry
OL,13,Fin Houston after an Immigration and
OL,14,FCustoms Enforcement (ICE) officer
OL,15,Ffatally shot a man who was driving to
OL,16,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
